Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:07.49,TL,,0,0,0,,美网半决赛 谢尔顿挡住了蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:09.44,TL,,0,0,0,,到了{\fs78}11{\fs68}月 又是谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:12.18,TL,,0,0,0,,替他锁定了第一张都灵门票
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:14.32,TL,,0,0,0,,先回到澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.76,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮对德米纳尔 他{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘落败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:20.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月阿卡普尔科 他打到决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.56,TL,,0,0,0,,两盘输给科博利 收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:30.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Acapulco belongs to Flavio.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿卡普尔科 属于弗拉维奥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Cobolli the champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科博利 冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:37.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A second ATP 500 title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二座五百分赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:41.46,TL,,0,0,0,,法网第四轮 打了{\fs78}5{\fs68}小时{\fs78}26{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:43.23,TL,,0,0,0,,他曾盘分{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.13,TL,,0,0,0,,第四盘也领先{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.59,TL,,0,0,0,,最后却被阿尔纳尔迪逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:48.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}月哈雷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:51.94,TL,,0,0,0,,先在{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.79,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛两盘击败弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:56.56,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯首个{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:18.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a fourth ATP Tour title for Frances Tiafoe,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N蒂亚福收获生涯第四座巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the biggest of his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是他生涯分量最重的一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:23.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the score]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判报分】
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.22,0:01:28.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The first American to win the title here in Halle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首位在哈雷夺冠的美国球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:31.10,TL,,0,0,0,,带着哈雷冠军来到温网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:34.43,TL,,0,0,0,,他在第三轮{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘输给布勃利克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:43.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the result and score]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判宣布比赛结果和比分】
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, it was a different result four years ago,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N四年前的结果可不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:50.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}it was Tiafoe going through to the last 16.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那次晋级第四轮的是蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:53.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time it is Alexander Bublik{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 亚历山大 布勃利克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who will take his place in round four.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿到了第四轮的席位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:59.46,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 在蒙特利尔因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.02,TL,,0,0,0,,右手接受手术后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:04.02,TL,,0,0,0,,他又在辛辛那提闯进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:06.43,TL,,0,0,0,,对菲斯 他扳回第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.71,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘却一局未得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.62,TL,,0,0,0,,第二次打进大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:12.56,TL,,0,0,0,,还是收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:23.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Arthur Fils.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quite scintillating in Cincinnati.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在辛辛那提大放异彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:35.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is the biggest title of his young career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他年轻生涯分量最重的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.78,TL,,0,0,0,,美网{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛 先丢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:46.01,TL,,0,0,0,,第三盘又一度{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.01,0:02:49.68,TL,,0,0,0,,他最后连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘 逆转米切尔森
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:58.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the winner]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判宣布比赛胜者】
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:05.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A comeback that is extra special for Frances Tiafoe.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场逆转 对蒂亚福意义非凡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.54,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛对谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:10.24,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 随后连丢{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:11.83,TL,,0,0,0,,第三次美网{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:14.24,TL,,0,0,0,,他还是没能更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's crazy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:32.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Umpire announces the result]{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N【裁判宣布比赛结果】
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:37.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}[Shelton] is in the championship match of the 2026 US Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿晋级{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And what a pity it had to end on a double fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N遗憾的是 比赛竟以一次双误结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.28,TL,,0,0,0,,上海 维也纳 再到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:47.42,TL,,0,0,0,,他遭遇了三连败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:50.57,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}4{\fs68}日 巴黎第二轮输给阿利斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:53.96,TL,,0,0,0,,这个结果先让菲斯锁定了年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:57.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}6{\fs68}日 谢尔顿在巴黎击败保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.71,TL,,0,0,0,,蒂亚福终于锁定资格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.90,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次走进都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.80,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}截至{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}7{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.74,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}蒂亚福{\fs78}3390{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.89,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}排名赛季积分榜第八
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.35,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}高亮的{\fs78}8{\fs68}位球员
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:11.61,TL,,0,0,100,,{\an2}都已锁定年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.34,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次到都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:16.21,TL,,0,0,0,,你看好蒂亚福拿到几场胜利？
